#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:1
msgid "HistoryPanel 与可选「FactorResearch」辅助层（评估结论）"
msgstr ""
"HistoryPanel and the optional “FactorResearch” helper layer (evaluation "
"conclusions)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:3
msgid ""
"本文档回答路线图中的评估项：**是否需要在 `HistoryPanel` 之上再抽象一层轻量 API（工作名 "
"`FactorResearch`），专门计算 IC/IR、分位数组合收益、long-short 曲线等？**"
msgstr ""
"This document answers the evaluation item in the roadmap: **Do we need to "
"add another lightweight API abstraction layer on top of `HistoryPanel` "
"(working name `FactorResearch`), dedicated to computing IC/IR, quantile-"
"portfolio returns, long-short curves, etc.?**"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:5
msgid "1. 当前能力边界（已满足的部分）"
msgstr "1. Current capability boundaries (what is already covered)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:7
msgid "以下能力已由 `HistoryPanel` 及相关 API 覆盖，无需重复造轮子："
msgstr ""
"The following capabilities are already covered by `HistoryPanel` and related"
" APIs—no need to reinvent the wheel:"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:9
msgid "**因子列生产**：`assign`、`__setitem__`、`returns`、`kline`、`apply_ta` 等；"
msgstr ""
"**Factor column generation**: `assign`, `__setitem__`, `returns`, `kline`, "
"`apply_ta`, etc.; "

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:10
msgid "**截面变换**：`rank`、`zscore(method='cs'|'ts')`；"
msgstr "**Cross-sectional transforms**: `rank`, `zscore(method='cs'|'ts')`; "

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:11
msgid "**粗组合与基准**：`portfolio`（等权/加权、`groups`、`benchmark`）；"
msgstr ""
"**Coarse portfolios and benchmarks**: `portfolio` (equal-weight/weighted, "
"`groups`, `benchmark`); "

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:12
msgid "**研究向收益展示**：`cum_return`、`normalize` 与 `mask=`；"
msgstr ""
"**Research-oriented return display**: `cum_return`, `normalize`, and "
"`mask=`; "

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:13
msgid "**可视化**：`plot` 与 `(M,L)` mask 高亮；"
msgstr "**Visualization**: `plot` and (M,L) mask highlighting; "

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:14
msgid "**与计量工具衔接**：`to_df_dict`、手工长表化后接 pandas / statsmodels（见教程 2.5 §11）。"
msgstr ""
"**Integration with measurement/analytics tools**: `to_df_dict`, or manually "
"reshape to long format and then use pandas / statsmodels (see Tutorial 2.5 "
"§11)."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:16
msgid "对「轻量因子研究 + 粗验」目标，上述已构成**完整底座**。"
msgstr ""
"For the goal of “lightweight factor research + rough validation,” the above "
"already forms a **complete foundation**."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:18
msgid "2. 若增加 `FactorResearch` 层，能解决什么？"
msgstr "2. If we add a `FactorResearch` layer, what can it solve?"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:20
msgid "典型封装可包括："
msgstr "Typical wrappers may include:"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:22
msgid "给定 **因子列** 与 **收益列**（或标签），输出 **逐期 IC**、**IC 均值/IR**；"
msgstr ""
"Given a **factor column** and a **return column** (or label), output **per-"
"period IC**, **IC mean/IR**;"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:23
msgid "**分位数组合**（按截面分桶）的净值或收益序列；"
msgstr ""
"A NAV or return series of a **quantile portfolio** (bucketed by cross-"
"section);"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:24
msgid "**多空组合**（top minus bottom）的时间序列。"
msgstr "A time series of a **long-short portfolio** (top minus bottom)."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:26
msgid ""
"这些均可用现有 `rank` / `portfolio` / `values` + pandas **在用户侧或独立模块中**几十行实现；封装的价值在于"
" **API 稳定、参数约定统一、减少复制粘贴错误**。"
msgstr ""
"All of these can be implemented in a few dozen lines on the user side or in "
"an independent module using existing `rank` / `portfolio` / `values` + "
"pandas; the value of wrapping lies in **stable APIs, unified parameter "
"conventions, and fewer copy-paste errors**."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:28
msgid "3. 结论（短期不引入类库级 `FactorResearch`）"
msgstr ""
"3. Conclusion (do not introduce a library-level `FactorResearch` in the "
"short term)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:30
msgid "**结论：当前阶段不在 qteasy 内核或 HistoryPanel 上强制增加 `FactorResearch` 类/子模块。**"
msgstr ""
"**Conclusion: at the current stage, we will not force the addition of a "
"`FactorResearch` class/submodule to the qteasy kernel or on top of "
"HistoryPanel.**"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:32
msgid "理由简述："
msgstr "Brief rationale:"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:34
msgid ""
"**职责清晰**：`HistoryPanel` "
"已定位为三维研究容器与显式对齐/重采样；IC/IR、分位组合等属于**研究工作流约定**更强的「分析配方」，放在独立教程、示例或未来可选包中更合适，避免"
" HP API 膨胀。"
msgstr ""
"**Clear responsibilities**: `HistoryPanel` is already positioned as a 3D "
"research container with explicit alignment/resampling; IC/IR, quantile "
"portfolios, etc. are “analysis recipes” with much stronger **research "
"workflow conventions**. They fit better in standalone tutorials, examples, "
"or a future optional package, to avoid HP API bloat."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:35
msgid ""
"**避免错误预期**：单独命名模块易让用户以为框架已内置「发表级因子检验」（如多重检验、样本划分、HAC 标准误），而实际仍需用户在 "
"statsmodels 等侧完成推断。"
msgstr ""
"**Avoid wrong expectations**: naming it as a standalone module can easily "
"make users think the framework already includes “publication-grade factor "
"testing” (e.g., multiple testing, sample splitting, HAC standard errors), "
"while in reality users still need to do inference on the statsmodels side, "
"etc."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:36
msgid ""
"**与中期「内置因子库」的关系**：顶层路线图中的 **内置因子库（M2.1）** 若落地，更自然的做法是 **因子定义 + 注册 + 与 "
"FactorSorter/回测衔接**；批量 IC/分层可作为因子库周边的 **可选工具函数**，而非 HistoryPanel 实例方法。"
msgstr ""
"**Relationship with the mid-term “built-in factor library”**: If the "
"**built-in factor library (M2.1)** in the top-level roadmap is implemented, "
"a more natural approach would be **factor definition + registration + "
"integration with FactorSorter/backtesting**; batch IC/stratification can be "
"**optional utility functions** around the factor library, rather than "
"HistoryPanel instance methods."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:37
msgid "**维护成本**：IC 需约定收益前瞻窗口、停牌、退市、权重（市值加权 vs 等权）等，参数组合多，若无统一数据契约易引发支持成本。"
msgstr ""
"**Maintenance cost**: IC needs conventions for the forward return window, "
"trading halts, delistings, weights (value-weighted vs equal-weighted), etc. "
"There are many parameter combinations; without a unified data contract, it "
"can easily drive up support costs."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:39
msgid "4. 若未来引入，建议形态（备忘）"
msgstr "4. If introduced in the future, suggested form (memo)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:41
msgid ""
"若社区需求明确，推荐 **独立模块**（例如 `qteasy.research.factor_stats` 或项目外 `qteasy-"
"research`），而非 `HistoryPanel` 方法："
msgstr ""
"If community demand is clear, recommend an **independent module** (e.g., "
"`qteasy.research.factor_stats` or an external `qteasy-research` project), "
"rather than `HistoryPanel` methods:"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:43
msgid "入参：`HistoryPanel` 或 `DataFrame` + 列名 + 前瞻期数；"
msgstr ""
"Inputs: `HistoryPanel` or `DataFrame` + column name + forward-looking "
"periods;"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:44
msgid "出参：`DataFrame` / `Series`（可再绘图为辅）；"
msgstr ""
"Outputs: `DataFrame` / `Series` (optionally re-plotted as a supplement);"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:45
msgid ""
"文档：明确 **非** 替代 Backtester，且 **不** 内置 Fama–MacBeth / Newey–West（仍导出到 "
"statsmodels）。"
msgstr ""
"Docs: clearly state that it is **not** a replacement for the Backtester, and"
" that it **does not** have built-in Fama–MacBeth / Newey–West (still export "
"to statsmodels)."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:47
msgid "届时应配套 **TDD** 与英文 `ValueError` 契约，与现有 HP 测试风格一致。"
msgstr ""
"At that point, it should come with **TDD** and English `ValueError` "
"contracts, consistent with the existing HP test style."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:49
msgid "4.1 路线图衔接（2026-08-11）"
msgstr "4.1 Roadmap connection (2026-08-11)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:51
msgid ""
"顶层任务 **M2.2** 已将上述「独立模块」形态纳入二阶段实施范围（函数 API：`factor_ic` / "
"`quantile_portfolio` / `long_short_return` 等），并与 HP 内核 pandas "
"级补齐（`shift`/`diff`/`dropna`/`expr` 等）同批规划。"
msgstr ""
"The top-level task **M2.2** has included the above \"independent module\" "
"form into the second-stage implementation scope (function API: `factor_ic` /"
" `quantile_portfolio` / `long_short_return`, etc.), and complemented it with"
" the HP kernel pandas level (`shift`/`diff`/`dropna`/`expr` etc.) planning "
"in the same batch."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:53
msgid ""
"执行计划：[m2.2_hp二阶段扩展_da0c19a3.plan.md](../../../.cursor/plans/m2.2_hp二阶段扩展_da0c19a3.plan.md)"
msgstr ""
"Execution plan: [m2.2_hp two-stage "
"expansion_da0c19a3.plan.md](../../../.cursor/plans/m2.2_hp two-stage "
"expansion_da0c19a3.plan.md)"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:54
msgid "进度真源：顶层展望 §7.1 **M2.2**"
msgstr "The True Source of Progress: Top-Level Outlook §7.1 **M2.2**"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:55
msgid ""
"**截至 CP-A（Phase 1–3）**：HP 内核已落地 `shift` / `diff` / `pct_change`、`bfill` / "
"`dropna`、填充类 `inplace=`、以及 `expr`；用户文档见教程 2.4/2.5 与 [HistoryPanel "
"API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"**As of CP-A (Phase 1–3)**: HP kernels have been implemented `shift` / "
"`diff` / `pct_change`, `bfill` / `dropna`, padding classes `inplace=`, and "
"`expr`; for user documentation, see tutorials 2.4/2.5 and [HistoryPanel "
"API](../api/HistoryPanel.rst)."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:56
msgid ""
"**截至 CP-B（Phase 4–6）**：HP 内核已落地 `drop` / `rename`、统计对称（`sum` / `median` / "
"`var` / `quantile`）、以及 `slice`/`segment`/`isegment`/`candle` 的英文弃用警告；文档同上。"
msgstr ""
"**As of CP-B (Phase 4–6)**: HP kernels have landed `drop` / `rename`, "
"statistical symmetry (`sum` / `median` / `var` / `quantile`), and English "
"deprecation warning for `slice`/`segment`/`isegment`/`candle`; documentation"
" is the same as above."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:57
msgid ""
"**截至 CP-D / CP-E（Phase 8–11）**：`qteasy.research` 已落地模块级 `factor_ic` / "
"`factor_ic_summary` / `quantile_portfolio` / `long_short_return`；HP 已落地 "
"`corr` / `cov`；导出推荐名与可跟跑示例见 [research API](../api/research.rst)、教程 2.5 "
"cookbook 与 `examples/historypanel_research_factor_workflow.py`。"
msgstr ""
"**As of CP-D / CP-E (Phase 8–11)**: `qteasy.research` has been implemented "
"at the module level `factor_ic` / `factor_ic_summary` / `quantile_portfolio`"
" / `long_short_return`; HP has been implemented `corr` / `cov`; for exported"
" recommended names and followable examples, see [research "
"API](../api/research.rst), Tutorial 2.5 cookbook with "
"`examples/historypanel_research_factor_workflow.py`."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:58
msgid ""
"本节 §3「短期不引入类库级 FactorResearch」结论仍然有效：M2.2 落地的是 **`qteasy.research` "
"模块级函数**，不是挂在 HistoryPanel 上的重型研究类。"
msgstr ""
"The conclusion in §3 of this section \"Library-level FactorResearch will not"
" be introduced in the short term\" is still valid: M2.2 implements "
"**`qteasy.research` module-level functions**, not heavy research classes "
"hanging on HistoryPanel."

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:60
msgid "5. 与教程的关系"
msgstr "5. Relationship to the tutorial"

#: ../../source/design/10-historypanel-factor-research-layer.md:62
msgid ""
"实操路径以 [教程 2.5：使用 HistoryPanel 操作和分析历史数据](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-"
"analysis.md) 的 §9–§11 为准；本设计文档仅记录 **架构层面的评估结论**，不增加用户必读的 API 面。"
msgstr ""
"For the practical workflow, follow §9–§11 of [Tutorial 2.5: Using "
"HistoryPanel to operate on and analyze historical "
"data](../tutorials/2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md); this design document "
"only records **architecture-level evaluation conclusions** and does not add "
"any must-read API surface for users."
